  "description": "For ten years, Seo-Jun has harbored a silent, unrequited crush on his best friend, Jae-Yun. But when Jae-Yun asks for a favor, Seo-Jun finds himself sharing a roof with his friend’s younger brother, Do-Yun. Living together reveals a different side of the family: while Do-Yun is quiet and unexpectedly tender, Jae-Yun’s perfect facade begins to crumble. Caught between a decade of devotion and a new, grounding confession, Seo-Jun must finally decide which brother holds the key to his heart. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
